(Formula Bank and Solved Examples) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
60 745 Td
(1. sigma = P/A. Example: 30 kN on 300 mm2 gives 100 N/mm2.) Tj
60 722 Td
(2. epsilon = deltaL/L. If stress=100 and E=200000, strain=0.0005.) Tj
60 699 Td
(3. deltaL = PL/AE. For L=1200 mm, elongation = 0.6 mm.) Tj
60 676 Td
(4. Thermal stress = E alpha deltaT = 200000 x 12e-6 x 50 = 120 N/mm2.) Tj
60 653 Td
(5. Simply supported UDL: max BM = wL2/8. For w=4 kN/m, L=6 m, BM=18 kNm.) Tj
60 630 Td
(6. Shaft torque: T=9550P/N. For 8 kW and 300 rpm, T=254.67 Nm.) Tj
